# Project Directory Structure

This document outlines the complete directory structure of the AI-powered Document Search & Summarization project.

## Root Directory

```
PROJECT_ROOT/
├── .cursor/
│   └── rules/              # Cursor IDE rules and guidelines
├── backend/                # NestJS backend application
├── frontend/               # React + TypeScript frontend application
├── kubernetes/             # Kubernetes deployment configurations
├── monitoring/             # Grafana monitoring dashboards and datasources
├── terraform/              # Infrastructure as Code (IaC) configurations
├── docker-compose.yml      # Docker Compose configuration for local development
├── README.md               # Main project documentation
├── QUICK_START.md          # Quick start guide
├── ROADMAP.md              # Project roadmap
├── ARCHITECTURE.md         # System architecture documentation
├── DEPLOYMENT.md           # Deployment instructions
├── CONTRIBUTING.md         # Contribution guidelines
└── IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md  # Implementation planning document
```

## Backend Structure (`backend/`)

NestJS application providing REST API and business logic.

```
backend/
├── src/
│   ├── main.ts                    # Application entry point
│   ├── app.module.ts              # Root application module
│   │
│   ├── ai/                        # AI/ML services module
│   │   ├── ai.module.ts
│   │   └── ai.service.ts          # AI summarization and processing
│   │
│   ├── database/                  # Database module
│   │   ├── database.module.ts
│   │   └── entities/
│   │       └── document.entity.ts # Document entity definition
│   │
│   ├── documents/                 # Document management module
│   │   ├── documents.controller.ts
│   │   ├── documents.module.ts
│   │   ├── documents.service.ts
│   │   └── services/
│   │       └── document-parser.service.ts # Document parsing logic
│   │
│   ├── elasticsearch/             # Elasticsearch integration
│   │   ├── elasticsearch.module.ts
│   │   └── elasticsearch.service.ts # Search indexing and queries
│   │
│   ├── queue/                     # Background job processing
│   │   ├── queue.module.ts
│   │   ├── queue.service.ts
│   │   └── processors/
│   │       └── document.processor.ts # Document processing jobs
│   │
│   ├── s3/                        # AWS S3 integration
│   │   ├── s3.module.ts
│   │   └── s3.service.ts          # File storage operations
│   │
│   ├── search/                    # Search functionality
│   │   ├── search.controller.ts
│   │   ├── search.module.ts
│   │   └── search.service.ts      # Search query handling
│   │
│   └── upload/                    # File upload handling
│       ├── upload.controller.ts
│       ├── upload.module.ts
│       └── upload.service.ts
│
├── Dockerfile                     # Backend container image
├── package.json                   # Backend dependencies
├── package-lock.json              # Dependency lock file
├── tsconfig.json                  # TypeScript configuration
├── nest-cli.json                  # NestJS CLI configuration
└── README.md                      # Backend-specific documentation
```

### Backend Module Organization

- **Modules**: Each feature has its own module (`.module.ts`) following NestJS conventions
- **Controllers**: Handle HTTP requests and responses
- **Services**: Contain business logic and external service integrations
- **Entities**: TypeORM database entity definitions

## Frontend Structure (`frontend/`)

React application with TypeScript, Vite, and Redux Toolkit.

```
frontend/
├── src/
│   ├── main.tsx                   # Application entry point
│   ├── App.tsx                    # Root React component
│   ├── index.css                  # Global styles
│   │
│   ├── components/                # Reusable React components
│   │   └── Layout/
│   │       └── Layout.tsx          # Main layout component
│   │
│   ├── pages/                     # Page components (routes)
│   │   ├── Dashboard.tsx          # Main dashboard page
│   │   ├── DocumentDetail.tsx     # Document detail view
│   │   ├── DocumentSearch.tsx     # Search interface
│   │   └── DocumentUpload.tsx     # Upload interface
│   │
│   ├── services/                  # API service layer
│   │   ├── api.ts                 # Base API client configuration
│   │   ├── documentService.ts     # Document API calls
│   │   ├── searchService.ts       # Search API calls
│   │   └── uploadService.ts       # Upload API calls
│   │
│   └── store/                     # Redux store configuration
│       ├── store.ts               # Redux store setup
│       └── slices/                # Redux Toolkit slices
│           ├── documentsSlice.ts  # Document state management
│           ├── searchSlice.ts     # Search state management
│           └── uploadSlice.ts     # Upload state management
│
├── Dockerfile                     # Frontend container image
├── index.html                     # HTML entry point
├── nginx.conf                     # Nginx configuration for production
├── package.json                   # Frontend dependencies
├── postcss.config.js              # PostCSS configuration
├── tailwind.config.js             # Tailwind CSS configuration
├── tsconfig.json                  # TypeScript configuration
├── tsconfig.node.json             # TypeScript config for Node.js tools
├── vite.config.ts                 # Vite build configuration
└── README.md                      # Frontend-specific documentation
```

### Frontend Architecture

- **Pages**: Top-level route components
- **Components**: Reusable UI components
- **Services**: API communication layer
- **Store**: Redux state management with Redux Toolkit

## Infrastructure & DevOps

### Kubernetes (`kubernetes/`)

Kubernetes deployment manifests for production environments.

```
kubernetes/
├── backend-deployment.yaml        # Backend service deployment
├── elasticsearch-deployment.yaml  # Elasticsearch cluster deployment
└── frontend-deployment.yaml       # Frontend service deployment
```

### Terraform (`terraform/`)

Infrastructure as Code for cloud resource provisioning.

```
terraform/
├── main.tf                        # Main Terraform configuration
├── variables.tf                   # Variable definitions
├── outputs.tf                     # Output values
├── terraform.tfvars.example       # Example variable values
└── lambda-function/               # AWS Lambda function code
    ├── index.js                   # Lambda handler
    └── package.json               # Lambda dependencies
```

### Monitoring (`monitoring/`)

Grafana dashboards and datasource configurations.

```
monitoring/
└── grafana/
    ├── dashboards/
    │   ├── dashboard.yml          # Dashboard provisioning config
    │   └── document-search-dashboard.json # Main dashboard definition
    └── datasources/
        └── datasources.yml        # Datasource configuration
```

## Important Configuration Files

### Root Level

- `docker-compose.yml`: Local development environment setup
- `README.md`: Main project documentation and overview
- `QUICK_START.md`: Quick start guide for new developers
- `ROADMAP.md`: Project roadmap and future plans
- `ARCHITECTURE.md`: System architecture documentation
- `DEPLOYMENT.md`: Deployment procedures and instructions
- `CONTRIBUTING.md`: Contribution guidelines
- `IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md`: Implementation planning details

### Backend Configuration

- `backend/package.json`: Backend dependencies and scripts
- `backend/tsconfig.json`: TypeScript compiler configuration
- `backend/nest-cli.json`: NestJS CLI settings
- `backend/Dockerfile`: Backend container image definition

### Frontend Configuration

- `frontend/package.json`: Frontend dependencies and scripts
- `frontend/tsconfig.json`: TypeScript configuration for frontend
- `frontend/vite.config.ts`: Vite build tool configuration
- `frontend/tailwind.config.js`: Tailwind CSS utility configuration
- `frontend/nginx.conf`: Production web server configuration
- `frontend/Dockerfile`: Frontend container image definition

## Key Directories Summary

| Directory | Purpose | Key Files |
|-----------|---------|-----------|
| `backend/src/` | NestJS application source code | Modules, controllers, services |
| `frontend/src/` | React application source code | Components, pages, services, store |
| `kubernetes/` | K8s deployment manifests | Deployment YAML files |
| `terraform/` | Infrastructure provisioning | Terraform configuration files |
| `monitoring/` | Observability setup | Grafana dashboards and configs |
| `.cursor/rules/` | Cursor IDE rules | Project-specific guidelines |

## File Naming Conventions

- **Backend**: kebab-case for files (e.g., `documents.service.ts`)
- **Frontend**: PascalCase for components (e.g., `DocumentUpload.tsx`), camelCase for utilities
- **Config files**: lowercase with extensions (e.g., `tsconfig.json`, `docker-compose.yml`)
- **Documentation**: UPPERCASE with underscores (e.g., `QUICK_START.md`)

## Module Dependencies

- **Backend**: NestJS modules follow dependency injection pattern
- **Frontend**: Services depend on base `api.ts` client
- **State Management**: Redux slices are independent but can share selectors

## Development Workflow

1. **Backend Changes**: Modify files in `backend/src/` following NestJS module structure
2. **Frontend Changes**: Modify files in `frontend/src/` following React component structure
3. **Infrastructure Changes**: Update Terraform files in `terraform/` directory
4. **Deployment**: Use Kubernetes manifests in `kubernetes/` for production
5. **Monitoring**: Update Grafana dashboards in `monitoring/grafana/`
